IMPORT `pti268-decision`

-- Tests for Part V, the table of injury rates and its six principles.
--
-- THE PER-ROW TESTS ARE GENERATED. Each line below was written by gen/table.py from the raw
-- text: it reads the two figures off the row's printed line by a different method from the
-- one that generated the data (it splits the line at the leader dots and dashes, where the
-- data generator matches a regular expression), so the two readings are independent of each
-- other and of the L4. The line number of the source is in the trailing comment.
-- The figures are percentages of the sum insured, as printed.

